B. 266 → 267 → 280 → 279A
C. 280 → 266 → 267 → 279A
D. 267 → 266 → 280 → 279A

<details>
<summary>Show answer</summary>

**Ans: B.** Art. 266 (CFI / Public Account) → 267 (Contingency) → 280 (FC) → 279A (GST Council).

